WEBVTT

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.180
Dragons live in that land...

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.800
Though one may doubt that the pacts between man and dragon

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.410
told of in folklore could truly exist,

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:19.150
even in this age of science, there is no question that behind a thick veil,

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:26.100
there exist dragons and those with the duty of protecting them: Dragon Dentists.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.340
Several decades have passed since

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:32.390
an international treaty was passed,
prohibiting dragons from engaging in warfare.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:37.010
Dragons are no longer
a symbol of a nation's might.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:40.810
Yet, the pacts with the dragons are still upheld.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.440
Shall I take your coffee?

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:51.740
It's fine.

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:55.370
But it doesn't look like I'll be getting any work done.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:58.370
I'm told that this is the largest typhoon of the year.

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:07.470
All the way out here?

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:10.710
I've never seen one in person before.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.420
Please remain calm.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.780
We're safe now.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:39.580
Everything is okay.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.290
Yes, it's fine.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.170
What about the typhoon?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.090
It seems the dragon ate it.

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:49.830
<i>Ate it?</i>

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.380
Did you die?

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:32.740
I'm obviously alive.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:33.630
What about you, Nonoko?

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.160
I'm totally fine.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:45.180
Is it floating?

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:50.150
Elder Godou said dragon's teeth never meet the earth.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.380
So this is what he meant.

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:11.790
It's because it left the dragon.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.670
This thing's just a stick now too.

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:17.380
What's it doing?

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.820
It's trying to get back to the dragon.

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.720
The dragon is over that way.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.510
We have to take it back soon.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.510
It's getting dark.

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:30.150
It's not safe to walk around when we don't even know where we are.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.650
The dragon's crying in pain right now!

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:38.570
So what are we supposed to do?

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:51.520
A boy and a girl!

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:52.480
Kids!

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:54.100
I don't see the tooth!

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.920
I saw it fall somewhere around here!

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:58.450
Keep looking!

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:00.880
They're soldiers from my country.

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:02.510
Why are they out here?

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:06.350
What have you been doing here, kid?

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:11.810
Wait a second...

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:12.980
Bell, is that you?!

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.360
Blanco, it's Bell!

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:15.390
Get over here!

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.150
How the hell are you alive?

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.150
What about Octavias' kid?

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:24.910
Blanco...

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:28.690
I thought he died.

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:30.330
I definitely saw his corpse!

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:32.750
Why are you even dressed like that?!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:36.490
Is it true that the Dragon Dentists are all dead?

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:38.460
Don't move, girl.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:39.920
What is that?

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:42.870
It's a dragon's tooth, isn't it?

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:45.930
Nonoko!

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:47.550
Blanco, it's the enemy!

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:56.970
Where's Blanco?

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:59.690
Blanco the Survivor is being himself again.

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:03.700
Captain Blanco, there are too many of them!

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:07.300
The dead come back to life, huh?

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.280
I see.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.910
So that's also the power of the dragon.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:14.510
Don't go dying here.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:15.670
Retreat!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:25.430
I'm honored to help a Dragon Dentist.

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:32.340
We received information regarding an enemy covert force in this area,

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.260
so we were looking for them here.

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.410
Is that a dragon's tooth?

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.070
We want to bring it back to the dragon as soon as we can.

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:43.330
We've sent a report.

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.840
Unfortunately the sun is down, so...

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:48.690
They fell from the dragon.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:50.640
Dragon Dentists can fly, can't they?

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:51.830
They're so young.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.110
Not as young as they look.

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:55.040
There's a Dentist from another country too.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:56.680
Shut up!

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:58.460
Show some respect!

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:00.550
Forgive them.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:03.610
They're all from Hokushu Sagoro.

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:05.800
They've never seen Dentists before.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:12.970
If it weren't for the dragon, my squad wouldn't have made it out of the northern area.

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:15.770
Please use this.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:24.020
By the way, can you ride a horse?

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:26.360
I can.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:36.460
You're impressive, Bell.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.110
It's just something I learned at school.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:41.050
You're the amazing one, Nonoko.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:43.610
You'll do anything for the sake of the dragon.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:50.490
We've arranged to send you
to the dragon tomorrow from Hokoadama Airport.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.100
Please get some rest here for tonight.

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:57.770
We've called for backup; it looks like they've started patrolling the mountains.

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:01.270
Rest assured that we'll keep you safe here.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:02.400
Excuse me.

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:05.150
Use this to wash your feet.

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:06.840
Thanks.

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:09.340
We've talked to the owners of this home.

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:13.040
We'll bring you something to eat right away,

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:15.500
although we only have field rations.

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:26.760
Aren't you going to eat?

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.840
I guess soldier food is the same wherever you go.

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:32.510
Well...

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:42.860
Here you go.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:46.800
Hey!

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:49.650
I told you not to come here.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.080
Good evening.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.910
Sorry for the intrusion.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:58.370
We're more than happy to be of assistance to Dragon Dentists.

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:00.210
Let's eat together.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:02.060
That's all right.

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:04.250
We're preparing the bath right now.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.080
Help yourselves after your dinner.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:11.800
Did you see how young those Dragon Dentists were?

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.180
I wonder if they're married.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.310
I can't wait for tomorrow.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:30.420
Why did those guys know about the dragon's tooth?

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:35.160
Shibana was a mole.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:38.660
They were probably supposed to take the tooth once it fell.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:39.700
No way.

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:42.830
It's still a war zone, even inside a dragon's mouth.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.750
Betrayals happen.

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.130
Captain!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.380
Captain Stapo!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.160
Take the captain.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:52.880
Anyone.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:55.440
What's the matter?

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:56.610
This is an order!

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:58.140
Carry the captain!

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:02.390
We're all going to end up dead, wasting time here.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:07.590
We still haven't lost the enemy because we keep bothering with the injured.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.650
We're going to leave him behind?

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:15.490
As your lieutenant, I'm ordering you: carry the captain.

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:20.280
Do it yourself, then, Octavias Junior.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:26.620
A dragon?

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:28.330
A dragon...

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.700
It's huge.

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.400
We're under the dragon's belly.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.300
That means we're still square in enemy territory!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:38.140
You know what happens when you violate orders, don't you?

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.600
Don't touch your guns!

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.200
We're right underneath the dragon.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:42.560
They could go off unpredictably.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:46.610
Looks like we won't have to shoot a round to attract the enemy.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:49.480
I've been watching you.

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:54.280
You haven't shot a single bullet on this battlefield.

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:57.310
You haven't pulled the trigger once.

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:04.530
I don't know if you're a coward or an idiot,

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:06.290
but this is your last job.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.670
Hold your scream.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:24.780
I remember the anger and the misery... all of it.

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.640
Yet it doesn't feel like it actually happened.

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:32.910
Between that, and sleeping here in a stranger's home with you,

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:35.590
I can't tell which is a dream.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.780
She said we might be married.

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:43.270
Did it bother you that they had the wrong idea?

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:51.090
Hey, what you said about my hair...

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:52.350
Your hair's pretty.

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:53.670
I like it.

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:57.170
Golden hair, like rice fields after rainfall.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:59.670
Your hair is like his.

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:00.740
It is?

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.310
You mean, the Dragon Dentist thing?

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:03.820
The "time?"

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:07.560
Good night.

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:57.140
With the dragon weakened, the Cavity Mushi are showing up so fast.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:12:00.370
The sun's up, and they're still not slowing down.

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:03.280
I don't know about going into a huge battle like this.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:06.870
Speak of the devil. Here we go.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.610
This is not a drill!

00:12:13.610 --> 00:12:14.860
Don't spare your ammo!

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:15.960
Crush them!

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:20.060
They must have been trying to buy time, but I won't let them.

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:23.110
No reports of accidental discharge or duds so far!

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:26.890
The intel is correct; the dragon can't use its power right now.

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:35.510
The dragon's "pact" means that it won't join the battle itself.

00:12:35.510 --> 00:12:37.780
Kill as many of them as possible!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:47.420
These are 15 cm fortress emplacement guns.

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:51.540
We have the dragon's wall, so I'm not worried about the attacks from outside.

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.030
We found the tooth.

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:57.250
It should be here with Nonoko and Bell soon.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:03.970
You're not coming with me? Why?

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.140
You don't want to be part of the war?

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:09.420
No.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:11.030
It's not about that.

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:12.560
What bothers me is

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:17.930
that you people know your "time,"

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.730
that you still don't do anything about it,

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.020
and that you accept your own deaths.

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:24.070
Everyone dies.

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:26.960
Why don't you try to live more?

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:29.740
I don't want to see you die.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:33.650
What are you going to do?

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:35.450
I don't know,

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:38.830
but I can't become a Dragon Dentist.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:48.350
You're okay with this?

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.730
We're moving out!

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:08.780
It's them!

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:13.100
There's a carrier waiting at the airport.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:15.720
The battle could start at any minute!

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:16.720
Let's hurry!

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:23.960
Bell's gone.

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:25.300
He fled.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.230
It's those men from yesterday.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:29.670
They're experts.

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:32.950
Enemy forces!

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:34.320
We'll hold them off here!

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:35.210
Take the Dentist!

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:35.660
Sir!

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.140
Everyone else, come with me!

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:03.810
We're going to plow through.

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:04.920
Hang on!

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:12.590
What the hell are the airport garrisons doing?

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:18.430
Take the tooth.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.270
Kill the girl.

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.020
I'll get the plane.

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:30.860
Bastard...

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.470
In front, Dentist!

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.670
W-What are you—

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:58.470
Can we fly?

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.060
It's a modified Bossa seaplane.

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:02.330
Get it ready.

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:03.060
We're leaving now.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:08.180
Keep your head down!

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:19.930
Got it!

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:20.750
The girl?

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:22.660
Who cares!

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:28.840
We got the dragon's tooth!

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:31.470
Gaelli and Lordly aren't here yet.

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:37.890
Just as planned.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.680
Nonoko!

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:48.440
Nonoko!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:50.020
Go after them!

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:51.030
Hurry!

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:02.040
They aren't after the dragon's tooth.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:05.130
They're planning to use the tooth to infiltrate the dragon's defenses.

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:13.500
What are we supposed to do, Nonoko?

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:20.440
Nonoko!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.640
You're crazy!

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:24.690
Come, Bell!

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:49.000
Seriously, what are we going to do?

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:03.980
Nonoko!

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:24.060
What's the matter?

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:25.300
Nothing.

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:28.540
It's ours to lose now, huh?

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:32.010
The dragon's protected by an invisible wall.

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:33.930
We can't do anything to it from outside.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:37.510
But with a tooth, that changes.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:40.140
A dragon's tooth tries to return to the dragon.

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:45.000
The dragon won't get in our way if we have the tooth.

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:05.870
What the—

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:10.800
The dragon's tooth!

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:11.980
Stop her!

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:16.800
Unbelievable.

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:17.720
Wow.

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:34.940
Big Sis Shibana!

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:37.570
You'd still call me "Big Sis," huh?

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:40.030
Hold on to the tooth.

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:55.210
I owe you one.

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.320
Quite the blunder.

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.380
Big Sis, why are you with them?

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:03.570
People everywhere hate dragons.

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:05.640
And Dentists, too, of course.

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:08.480
Where's the other boy?

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:14.160
There will be no more Dragon Dentists after today.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:22.120
Whoa, whoa.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:24.220
The right wing is totally defeated.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:26.160
To think they'd attack from the fortress...

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:29.790
We'll have no chance of winning if our Arane artillery gets taken down!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.310
We can't depend on the dragon today.

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:34.080
Let's take the city perimeter and flank them.

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:44.590
The dragon was your last hope, and now that's going to be dead too.

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:47.510
It's the dragon.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:50.640
Is that really an invisible wall?

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:53.070
Approach it from under the belly.

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:55.440
We don't want to get noticed before we land.

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:58.030
We've lost contact with the carrier?

00:20:58.030 --> 00:21:00.150
That's not the planned route!

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:07.510
We're going to get shot down by friendly fire!

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:10.420
They won't hit us with Blanco the Survivor on board!

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:12.960
I'm counting on you.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:19.620
We're clear!

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:33.860
Get out.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.350
You're free to kill everyone on the dragon.

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:37.130
Prepare yourselves!

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:37.900
Yes, sir.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:39.740
Bell!

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:40.950
Nonoko!

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:44.570
What the hell is that?

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:52.660
It regained the dragon's strength, now that we're inside the wall!

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:53.370
Hand over the tooth!

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:01.800
What's going on?

00:22:04.810 --> 00:22:06.040
The wing!

00:22:06.040 --> 00:22:08.810
Land somewhere, anywhere!

00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:34.250
Blanco, are you safe?

00:22:35.260 --> 00:22:36.450
Where's the dragon's tooth?

00:22:37.150 --> 00:22:38.480
We don't need it anymore.

00:22:39.140 --> 00:22:41.040
Where's the real treasure?

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:44.430
How many are alive?

00:22:44.860 --> 00:22:46.640
The tooth's back.

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:47.920
Nonoko's back?

00:22:48.230 --> 00:22:49.800
But something's not right.

00:22:56.660 --> 00:22:59.560
You'd better become a fine woman, Nonoko.

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:08.870
Oh, please...

00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:19.200
Shibana.

00:23:19.640 --> 00:23:21.090
Just what do you think you're doing?

00:23:21.090 --> 00:23:23.800
Were you the one that brought those men up there too?

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:26.470
Get off the dragon, now.

00:23:26.890 --> 00:23:27.980
Don't be silly.

00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:29.470
This is where Dragon Dentists work.

00:23:29.780 --> 00:23:32.370
I'll get rid of your workplace for you.

00:23:32.370 --> 00:23:33.660
Why?

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:35.520
Takemoto, whom you loved so much...

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:36.630
She loved him?

00:23:36.630 --> 00:23:39.600
He met his "time" to protect this place.

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:53.480
That's what I detest.

00:23:55.790 --> 00:23:58.670
People go to the other side of the teeth when they die, do they not?

00:24:00.100 --> 00:24:03.590
That man's soul is still inside the dragon's teeth!

00:24:03.930 --> 00:24:05.750
You can't...

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:08.750
...want to bring back Takemoto?

00:24:09.210 --> 00:24:11.710
He's already dead; he's not coming back!

00:24:11.710 --> 00:24:13.880
Only the dragon can do that!

00:24:13.880 --> 00:24:16.520
It's not something a human can do!

00:24:17.090 --> 00:24:20.730
I'm not human anymore!

00:24:39.350 --> 00:24:40.690
Shibana!

00:24:56.010 --> 00:24:57.180
What the hell is his deal?

00:24:57.840 --> 00:24:59.890
He doesn't even have a dragon's cloak. Why can't we hit him?

00:25:00.190 --> 00:25:01.350
Damn it!

00:25:13.110 --> 00:25:14.430
Let's go, Bell.

00:26:32.400 --> 00:26:33.690
Okay, we got it.

00:26:34.330 --> 00:26:36.560
You didn't move this time, did you, Hama?

00:26:36.560 --> 00:26:39.700
Come on, smile a little, Takemoto.

00:26:39.700 --> 00:26:42.380
Jeez, you're always cold.

00:26:42.380 --> 00:26:44.420
I've never seen him smile, either.

00:26:46.720 --> 00:26:49.330
Up we go.

00:26:49.370 --> 00:26:50.450
Take this for me.

00:26:50.450 --> 00:26:51.330
I'll take this one.

00:26:55.400 --> 00:26:58.200
I guess it's not so great being whipped all the time.

00:27:18.670 --> 00:27:19.210
Hey.

00:27:24.760 --> 00:27:26.400
He's already dead.

00:27:27.130 --> 00:27:28.790
He's not coming back.

00:27:56.860 --> 00:27:57.400
Get back!

00:27:58.020 --> 00:27:59.320
Something's coming out!

00:28:08.000 --> 00:28:09.290
This is seriously bad!

00:28:09.710 --> 00:28:12.710
This Cavity Mushi is way too big!

00:28:12.710 --> 00:28:13.920
The dragon's not going to hold up!

00:28:19.350 --> 00:28:20.800
Charge!

00:28:57.560 --> 00:28:58.800
What just happened?

00:28:59.390 --> 00:29:00.440
It fell.

00:29:00.440 --> 00:29:01.550
The dragon fell.

00:29:07.770 --> 00:29:09.690
Are you okay, Nonoko?

00:29:09.690 --> 00:29:11.660
I can't believe the dragon would fall.

00:29:12.990 --> 00:29:13.730
Look.

00:29:18.700 --> 00:29:20.530
They're headed to the Dragon Palace.

00:29:27.120 --> 00:29:31.850
Now then, let's check out this so-called Dragon Palace.

00:29:37.190 --> 00:29:38.010
Back down.

00:29:38.910 --> 00:29:40.340
This is a sacred place.

00:29:41.830 --> 00:29:43.920
I have no business with priests.

00:29:50.140 --> 00:29:52.060
They're trying to get aboard!

00:29:53.280 --> 00:29:55.270
It's getting even bigger!

00:29:55.460 --> 00:29:57.280
What do we do, Go-san?!

00:29:57.650 --> 00:29:58.360
Shit...

00:29:59.650 --> 00:30:00.720
It's going to burst!

00:30:13.540 --> 00:30:15.290
Is that a Cavity Mushi too?

00:30:15.290 --> 00:30:17.080
I've never seen anything like it!

00:30:46.550 --> 00:30:47.540
It's terrible.

00:30:48.610 --> 00:30:51.950
It's not attacking just anyone, though.

00:30:57.930 --> 00:31:00.020
You're right, it's not attacking the medics.

00:31:00.880 --> 00:31:02.410
It's their intent.

00:31:02.410 --> 00:31:04.880
It's mowing down anyone with killer intent.

00:31:09.390 --> 00:31:11.260
What the hell is going on?!

00:31:11.260 --> 00:31:12.020
Stay strong!

00:31:12.020 --> 00:31:12.720
Fire!

00:31:15.470 --> 00:31:17.230
The 15 cm cannons aren't working?

00:31:17.230 --> 00:31:18.910
That's impossible!

00:31:22.490 --> 00:31:25.110
It sure is noisy outside.

00:31:28.300 --> 00:31:30.370
So this is the dragon's wisdom tooth, huh?

00:31:31.170 --> 00:31:32.930
It's a mirror and barrier.

00:31:33.860 --> 00:31:36.480
They've blindfolded it so it can't see the dragon.

00:31:36.480 --> 00:31:38.250
The dragon's wisdom tooth?

00:31:38.750 --> 00:31:43.220
There's one tooth that won't cause the dragon any pain, should it fall out:

00:31:43.220 --> 00:31:44.900
the wisdom tooth.

00:31:45.440 --> 00:31:49.640
The people of this country got a hold of it, and then formed a pact with the dragon.

00:31:50.200 --> 00:31:51.870
Without it,

00:31:51.870 --> 00:31:55.720
the very contract that was held with the dragon for a thousand years would vanish,

00:31:56.120 --> 00:31:59.180
along with the bullshit of the dead coming back to life.

00:32:01.180 --> 00:32:02.400
Wait a second!

00:32:02.400 --> 00:32:04.980
I thought we were going to sell it for money!

00:32:08.260 --> 00:32:09.530
I'll need more than a gun.

00:32:32.580 --> 00:32:34.770
How many people are going to die?

00:32:35.300 --> 00:32:38.390
It's not going to stop until they're all dead, is it?

00:32:38.860 --> 00:32:41.360
It's a Cavity Mushi that does nothing but slaughter.

00:32:48.510 --> 00:32:50.320
It's gone so far.

00:32:51.160 --> 00:32:53.430
How far is it going?

00:32:54.390 --> 00:32:59.020
Nonoko, how do you think this Mushi got so big?

00:32:59.390 --> 00:33:00.880
Because it's eating people?

00:33:02.100 --> 00:33:03.220
It isn't eating people.

00:33:04.000 --> 00:33:06.880
It's just killing people who want to kill others.

00:33:10.190 --> 00:33:14.160
In which case, it isn't getting sustenance from its head or its fingers.

00:33:15.230 --> 00:33:15.890
It's the root.

00:33:19.000 --> 00:33:22.930
As terrifying as it is, it's still a Cavity Mushi.

00:33:23.290 --> 00:33:25.560
It's killing people with murderous intent

00:33:26.160 --> 00:33:29.220
and sucking up their souls from the dragon's teeth.

00:33:29.730 --> 00:33:32.490
It's using the souls of the murderous as nourishment.

00:33:33.050 --> 00:33:36.870
Is it because the tooth broke that it came out?

00:33:36.870 --> 00:33:38.700
We need to get this back, quickly.

00:33:39.310 --> 00:33:40.140
You're right.

00:33:40.520 --> 00:33:43.230
And you have to stop it at the root.

00:33:43.470 --> 00:33:46.480
It'll lose its sustenance and die.

00:33:46.480 --> 00:33:47.760
Aren't you coming with me?

00:33:49.620 --> 00:33:50.620
No.

00:33:50.620 --> 00:33:52.800
We're Dragon Dentists.

00:33:57.220 --> 00:33:58.940
Let's go together.

00:34:04.210 --> 00:34:08.420
I don't think I can become a Dragon Dentist.

00:34:09.050 --> 00:34:11.480
There are things I have to do.

00:34:13.600 --> 00:34:15.190
Go, Nonoko.

00:34:19.150 --> 00:34:21.330
You're a Dragon Dentist!

00:34:21.330 --> 00:34:23.450
I said so, and that makes us partners!

00:34:23.450 --> 00:34:25.750
That hurt, man!

00:34:26.090 --> 00:34:27.610
I'll be waiting down over there!

00:34:27.610 --> 00:34:29.540
Hurry up and finish your business!

00:34:54.350 --> 00:34:56.040
There's something I want to ask you.

00:34:57.450 --> 00:35:00.040
I heard you were revived by the dragon's power.

00:35:00.040 --> 00:35:01.410
How were you chosen?

00:35:02.040 --> 00:35:03.900
The dragon decides all of it.

00:35:05.970 --> 00:35:07.430
Whatever.

00:35:07.800 --> 00:35:09.910
The pact with the dragon is ending.

00:35:10.480 --> 00:35:11.920
Remember what I told you,

00:35:12.310 --> 00:35:16.090
"You're too much of a coward to pull the trigger."

00:35:16.720 --> 00:35:19.670
I'm not stupid enough not to have figured that out by now.

00:35:20.620 --> 00:35:22.050
But did you know?

00:35:23.540 --> 00:35:26.050
You're not the kind of man

00:35:26.050 --> 00:35:28.810
that can restrain your murderous impulse with a gun pointed towards you, are you?

00:35:29.340 --> 00:35:30.480
You're right about that.

00:35:31.850 --> 00:35:33.650
Die, Dentist!

00:36:05.720 --> 00:36:09.120
Blood enters my lung, and I die by suffocation.

00:36:10.020 --> 00:36:12.060
This is my second time drowning.

00:36:12.060 --> 00:36:14.060
The first time was when I was twelve.

00:36:15.370 --> 00:36:17.860
I tried to ride through a pond in the yard on my horse.

00:36:18.290 --> 00:36:22.410
Just as I passed the middle, the deepest part of the pond,

00:36:22.410 --> 00:36:24.700
the horse shook me off spectacularly.

00:36:25.770 --> 00:36:27.620
My horse swam away.

00:36:27.620 --> 00:36:31.450
I couldn't breathe, let alone call for help.

00:36:31.950 --> 00:36:36.580
All I could do was flail with my arms and legs.

00:36:37.690 --> 00:36:40.940
It was one of my servants who saved my life.

00:36:41.630 --> 00:36:43.790
I don't even remember their name anymore.

00:36:44.570 --> 00:36:48.670
My sister berated me for nearly dying.

00:36:49.430 --> 00:36:51.960
I haven't spoken to her since.

00:36:53.060 --> 00:36:58.940
My horse had nearly killed me with the ease of flicking away an insect with its tail.

00:36:59.780 --> 00:37:02.030
And yet I loved her.

00:37:02.980 --> 00:37:05.270
My horse was beautiful.

00:37:05.270 --> 00:37:09.520
And if I hadn't had the stupid idea of riding over a big pond on her back,

00:37:09.520 --> 00:37:12.020
she would have stayed a faithful friend.

00:37:12.920 --> 00:37:20.170
My horse casually made her way back to shore and shook herself dry in the afternoon sun.

00:37:20.890 --> 00:37:27.280
As I was about to die, I watched her in a strangely serene state, struck by her majesty.

00:37:28.700 --> 00:37:31.890
If Cavity Mushi are the scraps of human minds,

00:37:32.490 --> 00:37:38.230
then I wonder if the feeling of being awed by something's beauty would also cause cavities.

00:37:39.850 --> 00:37:43.840
Even though it's huge, the dragon is worthy of compassion.

00:37:44.650 --> 00:37:47.160
I want to do everything I can so that it doesn't get cavities.

00:37:48.060 --> 00:37:52.160
But unfortunately, there's nothing I can do to stop my own feelings.

00:37:53.790 --> 00:37:57.880
Besides, if a Mushi were to be born from my heart,

00:37:58.910 --> 00:38:01.440
I could count on the Dentists to take care of it.

00:38:02.480 --> 00:38:04.970
They'll protect the dragon.

00:38:05.650 --> 00:38:10.510
I wonder if she'll laugh again when she hears my voice seeping through the teeth.

00:38:11.310 --> 00:38:15.920
Or will she just walk away, indifferent, and return to work?

00:38:17.540 --> 00:38:21.080
I don't know why, but I can't help

00:38:21.660 --> 00:38:24.270
but think of you and that horse in the same light.

00:38:25.230 --> 00:38:31.060
When I think of you, something other than blood fills my chest.

00:39:50.720 --> 00:39:52.410
Did you get to meet Takemoto?

00:39:54.360 --> 00:39:58.700
Listen, Shibana, love isn't only about desiring someone.

00:39:59.340 --> 00:40:02.980
It can be about cherishing them in your memory after they're gone.

00:40:03.460 --> 00:40:06.670
I've become a monster, and you're still going to lecture me about cherishing?

00:40:07.190 --> 00:40:08.170
You've seen the mark, haven't you?

00:40:09.200 --> 00:40:12.890
No matter what you may look like, you're still a Dentist.

00:40:15.380 --> 00:40:18.190
I won't give up.

00:40:21.760 --> 00:40:23.310
She sure is brave.

00:40:24.190 --> 00:40:25.870
I'd never have thought to do what she did.

00:40:26.280 --> 00:40:28.990
Maybe something will come of it someday.

00:40:29.590 --> 00:40:32.200
Big Sis is so beautiful.

00:40:33.480 --> 00:40:36.790
What's she going to do now?

00:40:36.790 --> 00:40:37.900
Who knows?

00:40:37.900 --> 00:40:39.750
Anything could happen now.

00:40:41.590 --> 00:40:44.580
Man, it's fun to be alive.

00:40:45.110 --> 00:40:45.780
Huh?

00:40:46.160 --> 00:40:47.420
Where's Nonoko?

00:40:49.660 --> 00:40:53.450
Having died beneath the dragon and emerged from the dragon's teeth,

00:40:53.760 --> 00:40:56.710
I die aboard the dragon, and return to the dragon's teeth.

00:40:57.170 --> 00:41:02.460
Did I accomplish whatever purpose I was given in this curious cycle?

00:41:03.220 --> 00:41:07.580
Perhaps the answer doesn't concern me anymore.

00:41:08.490 --> 00:41:11.200
But I think it makes sense to me now.

00:41:12.460 --> 00:41:15.490
I don't know why the dragon chose me,

00:41:15.900 --> 00:41:19.180
but if it has to do with why I was brought back to life...

00:41:20.130 --> 00:41:22.870
I'm so glad I got to meet you.

00:41:24.680 --> 00:41:28.680
Thank you, Nonoko, my Dragon Dentist.

00:41:30.020 --> 00:41:32.320
Where are you, Bell?

00:41:32.320 --> 00:41:35.680
Let's finish our work and have dinner.

00:41:37.950 --> 00:41:39.060
Bell.

00:41:39.950 --> 00:41:41.470
Bell!

00:41:59.360 --> 00:42:01.680
Look at all this stuff.
